    "title": "Barbecue catering business to open for dining at its East Side outpost - NewsBreak",
    "text": "An East Side brisket and barbecue catering business is opening its doors for limited restaurant service next month. Potbelli BBQ will celebrate its grand opening on July 22 at its outpost next to the Frost Bank Center, 3363 E. Commerce St., Suite 104. The restaurant will be open on Mondays and Tuesdays, from 11 a.m. to 7 p.m., or until sold out. The rest of the week, it will focus on the catering business. ALSO READ: New Greek eatery set to open in former site of Pinch Boil House On the menu: brisket, ribs and pulled pork by the pound, sausage by the link and sandwiches. The eatery will also offer rotating sides from a list that includes mac and cheese, potato salad, candied pork and beans and green beans with bacon. Potbelli's specializes in custom smoked meats , according to its website, and it delivers to San Antonio and surrounding areas. It also ships barbecue to 48 states. Sign up for San Antonio Express-News newsletters here Read the original article on expressnews.com",
